    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Petro na Kornelio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korekoghe na mndumu andenyi ya muzi ghwa Kaisaria uwangwagha Kornelio, m'baa wa ijeshi jiwangwagha, “Ijeshi ja Kiitalia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orekoghe ukinugha dini na kumuobua Mlungu andwamweri na wandu wake wose. Ukakaia ukifunya makuwio mengi kwa wandu, na kulomba Mlungu matuku ghose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao sa saa ikenda ra dime, ukawona kwa mawono worinyi malaika wa Mlungu ukingia na kumzera, “Kornelio!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukamkuya meso ukiobua na kughamba, “Ni wada Bwana?” Ukamzera, “Malombi ghako na makuwio ghako ghajoka na kukaia lukumbuso imbiri ya Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana duma wandu Jopa, kummbange mndumu uwangwagha Simoni, irina jake ja kawi ni Petro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakanyagha na mndumu uwangwagha Simoni, ubonyagha kazi engira mirongo rangi; na nyumba yake eeka mbai na mbai ya bahari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uja malaika oreghoragha nao uendamsigha, Kornelio ukawiwanga wadumiki wake wawi, andwamweri na asikari umu unughagha dini wa awa werekoghe wikimdumikia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nao uendawija malagho ghose, ukawiduma Jopa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ja kawi, iji werekoghe wikighenda, ngelo wavika kaavui na muzi, Petro orekoghe wajoka aighu nyumbenyi kwenda lomba Mlungu sa saa irandadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukasikira njala, ukakunda kindo chingi cheja. Hata iji vindo verekoghe vikidekwa, ukawona mawono; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukawona mlungunyi kwarughulwa, na kilambo chimu chikisea sa nguwo mbaa andoenyi kwa mbembe rake inya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andenyi yaro korekoghe vichuku vose va nyamandu, na shimandu, na nyonyi ra mbeonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwaka lukamchea lukighamba, “Wuka Petro, bwagha kuje.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Petro ukaghamba, “Ii hata Bwana, jingi sijie kindo chingi cha wuchafu angu chiseelie anduangi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwaka lukamchea indo ja kawi lukighamba, “Icho Mlungu uchieleshere oho kusechiwange cha wuchafu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilagho iji jikabonyeka mando adadu, nao ahoeni icho kilambo chikawuswa nokoighu mlungunyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Petro orekoghe ukishinika, na kukunda kumanya kutambua kwaro mawono agho, waja wandu weredumiloghe ni Kornelio nyuma ya kukotia nyumba ya Simoni, wikakaia kimusi mbengenyi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wikikotia ngera Simoni uhu uwangwagha Petro wakaiagha aho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji Petro orekoghe ukiririkanya agho mawono, Roho ukamzera, “Ola wandu wadadu waawuyakulola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuka kusee kughendanye nawo; kusekaie na ngera ingi angu ni ini moni nawiduma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Petro ukasea, ukakwana nawo ukawizera, “Ni ini moni munilolagha, mwacha wada?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wikaghamba, “Kornelio, m'baa wa ijeshi, mundu wa hachi, umuobuagha Mlungu, uko na sare iboie kwa mbari yose ya Wayahudi; orezereloghe ni malaika mweli ukudumirie kughende nyumbenyi kwake, upate kusikira agho ghose kuchaaghora.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ukawikaribisha wikaie waghenyi wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ja kawi, ukawuka ukaghendanya nawo andwamweri na wanidu wamu kufuma Jopa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakesho yaro, wikangia Kaisaria. Kornelio orekoghe ukiwisuwiria, nao orekoghe wawiwanga wandu wa kichuku chake na waghenyi wake wa kaavui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji Petro wangia, Kornelio ukammara, ukaghwa maghunyi kwake na kumtasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Petro ukammbusira kimusi ukighamba, “Wuka kimusi, ini wori ne mdamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Petro orekoghe ukidedanya na Kornelio, ukangia nyumbenyi na kukua wandu wakwanyika, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukawizera, “Inyo mmbeni mwamanya yadarighidwa kwa Myahudi kukuranganya angu kughenda kwa mndungi wa mbari zima. Ela Mlungu waniwonyere nisakemmbanga mndungi kukaia mchafu angu useelie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko niendadumilwa, nacha niseghirilo ni kindo chingi. Nakotia welee, mwaniwangiaki?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Kornelio ukaghamba, “Nerekoghe ngilomba Mlungu saa ikenda ra dime nyumbenyi kwapo; kufuma iyo ngelo, idime ni ituku ja kana. Ngammbona mundu uko kimusi imbiri kwapo, urwae nguwo ring'alaa-ng'ala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukaghamba, ‘Kornelio! Malombi ghako ghasikirwa, na makuwio ghako ghakumbukwa imbiri ya Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo, duma wandu Jopa kwa Simoni uwangwagha Petro ukaiagha nyumbenyi kwa Simoni ubonyagha kazi engira mirongo rangi; nao wakaiagha mbai na mbai ya bahari.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ngakudumiria shwa wori, na oho kwabonya nicha kucha. Kwa huwu idana deko aha diwose imbiri ya Mlungu, disikire malagho ghose kwaghorelwa ni Bwana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Machilo gha Petro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Petro ukazoya kuchila ukighamba, “Idana nawona loli Mlungu ndemtalagha mndungi kuchumba mmbao anduangi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuk. 10.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela mundu uo ose wa kula mbari umuobuagha uo, na kubonya agho ghiko gha hachi, wadamrumiria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyo mwamanya ijo ilagho orewighenjereghe Waisraeli, ukichila Ilagho Jiboie ja sere kwa chia ya Jesu Kristo (uo nuo Bwana wa wose). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilagho ijo, jerechililoghe isanga jose ja Judea jikizoia Galilaya nyuma ya wubaputizo ugho ghorechililoghe ni Johane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seji Mlungu oremshingieghe Jesu wa Nazareti mavuda kwa Roho Mweli, na kwa ndighi; nao ukamara-mara ukibonya nicha, na kuwiboisa wose werekorongeloghe ni uja Mmbiwi, angu Mlungu orekoghe andwamweri nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isi deko washahidi wa agho ghose oreghibonyereghe isanga ja Wayahudi na andenyi ya Jerusalemu. Nawo wikam'bwagha kwa kumnyonyoresha mdinyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela Mlungu oremrukishireghe ituku ja kadadu, ukam'bonya uwoneke worinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si kwa wandu wose, ela kodu isi deresaghuloghe ni Mlungu dikaie washahidi, nesi derejieghe na kunywa andwamweri nao nyuma ya kuruka kwake kufuma kwa wafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao oredilaghirieghe diwichilie wandu, na kushuhudia seji nuo moni uwikilo ni Mlungu ukaie Mtanyi wa awo wiko moyo na awo wifue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walodi wose wamshuhudia uo kukaia, uo ose urumiriagha kwake, uchalekwa kaung'a rake kwa irina jake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa mbari zima kuwusa Roho Mweli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Petro orekoghe ukighora, Roho Mweli ukawiseria wose werekoghe wikijisikira ijo ilagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na warumirii, awa werechanyeghe na Petro, nawo ni wandu wishamishiro wikashinika; angu inosi ja Roho Mweli jerediriloghe hata kwa awo wandu wa mbari zima wori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu werewisikireghe wikideda kwa viteto vizima, wikimkasa Mlungu. Niko Petro ukaghamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Welee, nani udimagha kughiria awa wandu wisebaputizo kwa machi, ehoku wammbusa Roho Mweli karakara nesi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ukafunya momu wibaputizo kwa irina ja Jesu Kristo. Nao wikamlomba ukaianye nawo matuku matini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
